Upstream version: v4.4.2 (tag)
Upstream source: https://github.com/KhronosGroup/KTX-Software/releases/tag/v4.4.2
Local modifications:
* Make Bash optional on Windows and generate lib/version.h via CMake when Bash
  is unavailable (extern/ktx/CMakeLists.txt, extern/ktx/cmake/version.cmake).
* Build and use the `ktx_read` library for Blender's native KTX2 import
  (see Blender-side integration in source/blender/imbuf/intern/format_ktx.cc).
